cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FrameAssembly: A Domain-Specific Language and Optimizing Compiler for Deterministic Network Traffic Generation"
message: "If you use FrameAssembly in your research, network security engineering, or AI training pipelines, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
